        "note": "4 rows: gasoline, diesel, E85 and electricity. Only gasoline and E85 reach the output: `emissionRateByAge` carries polProcess 111 for 484 gasoline and 484 E85 bin-rows, all at operating mode 300, and for none of the diesel or electricity ones.",
        "esio_format": "parquet"
      }
