        "note": "ZERO rows. This run selects two chained pollutants and MOVES chained neither, so the edge list is the four declared CO2AE edges, none of which touch these pollutant-processes.",
        "esio_format": "parquet"
      }
    },
    "db_runspeccounty": {
      "kind": "static",
      "source": {
        "url_template": "../../moves.rs/characterization/snapshots/rates-evap/tables/db__movesexecution1ccc0233_campuscluster_illinois_edu__runspeccounty.parquet"
